icials noting that conditions near t / Until that day, the lack of a clear, disclosed plan from the tournament organizers leaves "},{"severity":"warning","gate":"copy-edited","code":"near-duplicate-proximity","message":"Two sentences in one paragraph repeat multiple short phrases: While New York City has experienced hazy, orange skies throughout the week, the specific q / Until that day, the lack of a clear, disclosed plan from the tournament organizers leaves "}],"kind":"producing-content.standards-review"}

